  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level and every three gourmend levels thereafter, the gourmend gains a culinary talent, which expands the functionality of one or more of the culinary skillsets she chose at 1st level. In order to take a culinary talent, the gourmend must both meet its prerequisites and have chosen the culinary skillset(s) associated with the talent. See Culinary Talents, below, for a listing of all available talents. The Difficulty Class (DC) for a saving throw against a gourmend's culinary skillset ability or culinary talent is 10 + 1/2 the gourmend’s class level + the gourmend's Wisdom modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gourmend#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
